  "notes": [
    {
      "title": "Relay degrades to LAN",
      "text": "If the relay is unreachable the daemon retries with backoff in the background; the LAN URL keeps working.",
      "source": "src/server/relay.ts"
    },
    {
      "title": "Remote requests need token",
      "text": "Tunneled requests get x-forwarded-for, so the daemon requires the access token as for LAN clients.",
      "source": "src/server/relay.ts"
    },
    {
      "title": "No-daemon fallback is locked",
      "text": "If the daemon is gone, MCP writes .vibeprint/ under files.lock; after 5s of contention it errors 503.",
      "source": "src/mcp/backend.ts"
    }
  ],
